      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FATE AWAITS (5) galloped from a standing start but still managed to overcome a 20m handicap and win last week, his third success from his last four outings here. Multiple Group 1 winner who is in good form and looks suited back behind the mobile. The one to beat. RUBY RULES (4) landed a hat trick when she returned off a seven-week let-up and beat a good mare here last week. Tackles the boys this time but gets the same draw as last time and should be fitter for it. AIR EXPRESS (8) raced parked but toughed out a win here last week. This is stronger but he draws for a trail and has a decent record at this shorter distance. EXCLUSIVE HUSTLER (1) can be competitive from the ace draw.",
